     1844             input   'cost':U    ,
     1845             input   '##,##':U,
     1846             input   ""    ,
     1847             input   xTog-obj) .
     1848         End.
     1849         End case.
     1850      run calc-sub-itog (0).
     1851     If xshowcrsa OR  xshowsale or vat-crsa or vat-sale Then DO:
     1852       case  gds-zap-type :
     1853       when 'у':U THEN DO:
